"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.8263,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["'Replay calls transition_issue_by_name once per remaining hop, in order'","'if ANY replay hop raises ... abort replay ... No partial hop is retried'","get_issue resume logic (step 2) reads current Jira status and replays only hops after it"],"finding":"Replay can leave the Jira issue in a partially-applied intermediate state (e.g. hop 1 'In Progress' succeeds, hop 2 'Done' raises) and the plan states 'No partial hop is retried' but does not explicitly state that the intermediate remote state is acceptable/recoverable on the next reconcile pass.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f8823128ccf4daf82","impact":0.33,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 3 ('No partial hop is retried')","norm_id":"nbf5e08e8fd2fd931","priority":0.1237,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Mid-chain hop failure leaves remote status at an intermediate value neither original nor target"],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Add a sentence to step 3 noting partial state is durable and self-recovers on the next pass through the same resume-from-current-status path.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"Define replay_transition's return contract when the recorded hop list is empty or contains no hops after the current status (e.g. return False to fall through to comment-fallback/drift).","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.4763,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan defines abort only for 'If the current Jira status is not in the recorded sequence' and for hops that raise","recorded_status_hops globs *-STATUS.json which may legitimately return few/zero entries; no empty-list branch is described"],"finding":"The plan does not specify replay behavior when recorded_status_hops returns an empty list (or a single-element list equal to the current status) — i.e. the first-ever transition or a ticket with no prior STATUS events for the target. The failure/edge path is only defined for 'current status not in sequence' (AC6), not for 'no hops to replay'.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f9b6a5db46688d5ac","impact":0.33,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 1/2; Acceptance Criteria","norm_id":"n6278d811bfb7d843","priority":0.1237,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A newly created ticket whose only illegal direct hop has no intervening recorded intermediate hops — replay has nothing to walk."],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_